{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2908f07175141a357f9c1f7e12f7d56b54dfcf76e2a9894ee561d2bdc189113",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d69d5247cdbf26c44304be2be1febabb5184475549b7154ac00efb85f3b5f0ae",
      "text": "互帮互助",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b495b52677b1c6e0db1aa312ab5153c2d14eb8e7afea92635602c3ceb2d14c3c",
      "text": "道流收到了综合大楼同伴的某件商量事宜。\n尽管住户们竭尽全力，依然没有取得进展，\n听闻此事的制作人也决定提供协助。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d69d5247cdbf26c44304be2be1febabb5184475549b7154ac00efb85f3b5f0ae",
      "text": "互帮互助",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec5446fa4509da1972866402ad5618fb64382fd56b9c0e938f61954147d9a714",
      "text": "哎呀，有电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1541ee4eba67cb381344f85a9f6c6a9bebb5e4f324894999399cbe0d8d7eb1d5",
      "text": "喂，我是圆城寺。\n出什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0121e6f98509b3e87268918c2cdd94cae96584875ce241b685a7808ed6af7c69",
      "text": "……哎？不见了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de774f49243fee0aa05f2cafa934b86fd29b175f76fedfb5b68467f50175858",
      "text": "那大概是什么时候的事？\n对它可能会去哪里有线索吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08df1b13cad5120530045703f1ee792bb624739fbd1f99e6480e823ecf1d1cfd",
      "text": "这样啊……\n嗯，那是当然的！我也一起去找！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4e826d6f7a50bb8a319587a8d20e5458873d82982390de48e1d5bd764c7cfdc",
      "text": "虽然有工作，但没关系的！\n侦探先生平时也一直很照顾我嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2cf6221a4988a42a8772bec62e0a78c4023e6a5807dacb0a0896999eb58beb9",
      "text": "我一定会找出来的，\n希望也能这么转告老板娘一声！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4213b0d1e866eefa39f050f590a66deaa909a07a3cf7004d4bddba4afaf9d7e8",
      "text": "要是有什么情况，我这边也会联络的。\n……好的，那就先这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ed6668ab7ed2bf3e198b071ebe30da3290ca5f5f2041c3ded310fe13e52c8e",
      "text": "………这下可麻烦了。\n希望能快点找到啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64cd243ba82653f354e9a8b7413eae5757840993898ecfef946be75ddd7fe94",
      "text": "（……哈啊。\n今天也没找到有力的线索吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f392824f49861d6766ceae7a1725d530af6f890f620086d5d3715139985677",
      "text": "（虽然很着急，但现在能做的，\n也就只有贴寻物启事和打听情况这种踏踏实实的活动了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c2dab891ff6cabb2acef55724288be647d8b3dd24ed7daf5b179140d8e18d0c",
      "text": "（不能急躁，只能继续做现在能做的事。\n……话虽如此，压缩睡眠时间也是有极限的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4868b8c7ffe6daa17755d27fc8a5c497729435c3449a85cfa6676bfc7649823",
      "text": "……道流先生？\n您托我找的资料，我放在这里了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8a91082047995d4f4f3c3a805b2d9b97840aae6045914202822ff7c5bf0a4d5",
      "text": "……！不好意思，●●●●●●●●●●师父！\n我刚才走神了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af4b2fe485d0a1257041957098905712229001e30d0f6df96e3590f1fe86f32e",
      "text": "道流先生。\n最近发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:572407af343d255ecfbaa85e20ccccdc094102662aa4391786331ca87c8576e2",
      "text": "休息时间看起来也忙忙碌碌的，\n好像有点疲惫的样子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6210fe76dee0ce3b769e941a951a16d2f1f52ed66968eabff4d1464c29191b95",
      "text": "啊——……●●●●●●●●●●师父还真是\n什么都瞒不过你的法眼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8684d529769e8342dfe2065331b8c8d4c1210ad97dee11c7780b8afaf2068cbc",
      "text": "可以的话，能跟我聊聊吗？\n说不定我能帮上什么忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd37142a873e9f6bc8b6230ce9b498cc158ccdfbf237b614049593b5e5f55475",
      "text": "……也是呢。也不能总让●●●●●●●●●●师父\n一直替我担心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47a425e251f0bd4249f5a9615c9e205c7a46af098b255edbd6030081c7166e81",
      "text": "其实，从前一阵子开始，\n我就在找一只走失的小鸟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17afb6c906b0c7f2dfbfd058e9b4c4aae6953010e93e9781c547976acc9ed58a",
      "text": "走失的小鸟，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6895e29c53de1d993ce013ad61db6b1fa6888bd4a86fe586af6ee2393dfa6f35",
      "text": "我家拉面店所在的那栋综合大楼里，\n还有各种各样的其他店铺嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1c765798207e46e1ef6036c4a67accca198e928ff86a619692fb3c299eb5ba",
      "text": "比如个人经营的卡拉OK、\n占卜馆，还有小酒吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba49cf74ed82a1e077e7ba1678e1d3c703d6ede498fe20a73ccdc75faa0ba90e",
      "text": "那个小酒吧的老板娘养的小鸟，\n好像走失不见了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:126887d183e6d1a339c73fff6dde1cea200709978d1ecef4ee213378e7955c44",
      "text": "以大楼里开侦探事务所的人为中心，\n现在大家都在一起找那只小鸟呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3832d3c8abcf95ed950def7436a2dd47b18ee1d363dd29d77bdbe54360335d76",
      "text": "原来是这样啊……\n那真是让人担心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c78a9445aaea63f1e9b0f07b2921615fe379466080a772ce1a922ffa59ce2dc",
      "text": "我们那栋楼里的人，\n一直以来都是互帮互助着走过来的，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d4e2d2fe1373c74a14d662df11f82e4e0385740690f76b3a2bcfae44d14254",
      "text": "有人遇到困难的话，我就想出一份力嘛。\n话虽如此，这几天却一点线索都没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a93a0dbfe8f3a7df7c2f4e1812ee3ba1f45ac549db5119e67d8ad33ceaeb93",
      "text": "我也知道光着急是没用的，\n虽然心里明白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49c09c8e033d3c9c6072906694b9568504bff087e82bf2e8e1e61d40a8e07f8",
      "text": "……道流先生。\n既然这样，试试这种方法怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3842e1cfc97b0d030b11ede9dbd641c7c1f092fefbc1380c4456f88bc66e6dba",
      "text": "……以上，就是寻找走失猫咪的来信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ae37348e92225782697a5b58bcc2dfb720a5055b79857e73c49105c072426ed",
      "text": "有线索的人，\n如果能联系失主的话就太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7910acb3eb0309616bee6cf1eaa762a0dfe1d28ea44e651ab0c6604e2c6ee2a7",
      "text": "重要的家人不见了，一定会很不安吧。\n我也祈祷它能平安找到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:650d489855c3d23f52a9ef0bef9fd147639843e365ca1653a685ed3aa52cd651",
      "text": "……虽然不算是顺带提一嘴，\n但其实我最近也在找一只走失的小鸟……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10e1ff4684cdd0d09381f3b3b3b1c0a017a0e9f2ffc39fe56e6e331c16cf2a3d",
      "text": "尽管到处打听也贴了寻物启事，\n但怎么都找不到呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f92539b6c225989621437ddbd70f26b9e833a28887480e0ec69227b7b7fc49",
      "text": "如果大家身边有人在找走失的宠物，\n希望也能积极伸出援手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000050:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93adc0947748d65e0bfa06b9a95065adee54beae6080349c129e1f5afc920386",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，辛苦啦！\n按你的建议，我在节目里呼吁过了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeefb2937106504a27db9254d7536a27bc3b85dc860503a6c7b2d2e6ea13ec31",
      "text": "要是能收到反响就好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31fde7de90549428ec1cedf507a3bfbdfb9614496994aec28eb37d6606f60fb7",
      "text": "是的！要是能因此得到\n附近邻居的协助，那可就如有百人相助了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ee718c959ce1dc2c08ddff72fd1f84f06ff3e62cc1056b0783fa6f654914204",
      "text": "我也不会气馁，继续搜寻的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d2b3b84cb33a1554501966d8e8b3ea7e6429c973368c25ff228b793de42a2f",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c39064763ad52c9178d31ba869a044469638afc1887ad1bb168fe36758b5c787",
      "text": "哎呀～，不过说真的这次，\n可全靠道流酱帮大忙了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8962267b1bb2d79711be57fe5ae6f3095181ca013396a0e9fea7aea98459f51e",
      "text": "メイ酱它已经完全恢复精神了哦。\n现在都能自己吃饲料了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bc841f65e3ee57ce281917d0321df80227d7652a222f43a10fbb2c4c5efde3",
      "text": "道流酱，真的太谢谢你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7151436d302062c89ae1de28ccc2f656225d42e42ac23f04ae6b297348818ad",
      "text": "嘿嘿，怪不好意思的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d79a3d5f0def8f2c99c3d26ca3f683404ada70c85d87c0c1615f140bd10cab",
      "text": "竟然在广播里帮忙寻找走失的鸟，\n道流酱，你还真的是偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d68afb6cc962f59c9671056208d6059646c44847bc49eb91b4a47d43f902f615",
      "text": "我在这种事情上说谎也没用嘛！\n而且……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ded439abb9354e209509ac19e8668885836371fc5fae16d25cae660db2683e9d",
      "text": "提议在广播里呼吁大家的，\n是坐在这里的●●●●●●●●●●师父啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa1454b7bc8c685a28616bb66cdb22739c27ecd7958921b65fbaa48283f29a76",
      "text": "初次见面！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c199a4aa9e2e4f886b5551581ce5d4b54e3c2a600297c3e0144b2ecedf1282e",
      "text": "啊——！原来你就是传闻中的“师父”啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc513b8e72d48d2b3eeefee60a0f17f965f59806123652baf88e805ded5e76aa",
      "text": "因为道流酱一直叫你“师父”，我一直很好奇是个怎样的人呢。\n嘛，虽然听过不少关于你的事就是了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4368f2bd37df5cf0b193902c3eec6b99d93cf4227e16bc9534104eb10bdaa1c6",
      "text": "是、是这样吗。\n不过，到底是些什么事呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e2bff5abebd769312e2ec3d052d18f75889e75181f1f7af57217c0050597518",
      "text": "哎呀，这次也多亏了\n●●●●●●●●●●师父救场呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e85501586cba9a284cb664bd4a3f1357f1316affa1207031d6cb25bbbc65c347",
      "text": "要是●●●●●●●●●●师父遇到什么事，\n我无论如何都会第一时间赶过去的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a692d620d186810458644fa250a0a17f4117239102c61d6727990f2d2bd3a22a",
      "text": "请随时依赖我哦，\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
